        <h1 class="headline-1 bhoig__headline glue-grid__col--span-8 glue-grid__col--span-7-md glue-grid__col--span-8-lg">AMIE gains vision: A research AI agent for multimodal diagnostic dialogue</h1>

        

          <div class="basic-hero__description bhoig__description glue-grid__col--span-8 glue-grid__col--span-7-md glue-grid__col--span-8-lg">
            <div class="basic-hero--blog-detail__description"><p>May 1, 2025</p><span class="dot-separator"></span><p>Khaled Saab, Research Scientist, Google DeepMind, and Jan Freyberg, Software Engineer, Google Research</p></div>
          </div>

        

