<div class="blog-summary__update-wrapper">
    
    <div class="blog-summary__update-summary">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Update &bull; oct 06, 2026</p></div>
    <p data-block-key="r6rpj">Since the initial release of this blog post, this work has been published in <a href="https://www.nature.com/nm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i>Nature Medicine</i></a>. Read the <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-026-04371-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">peer-reviewed publication</a> for full details.</p>
</div>
    
</div>

<div class="blog-summary__summary">
    <p data-block-key="3ggzz">We share a first of its kind demonstration of a multimodal conversational diagnostic AI agent, multimodal AMIE.</p>
</div>
                        
